Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.18,0:01:18.52,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\3c&H247EB8&\blur4}若是乖乖听话 笑容会绽放吗
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.52,0:01:23.19,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\3c&HDD2BAA&\blur4}所以为什么向死而行
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.19,0:01:27.94,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\3c&HD97933&\blur4}为什么 如此喜怒无常
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.20,0:01:34.41,OP-CN,,0,570,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4\3c&H753ADC&}明是这地球枯株朽木
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.41,0:01:36.83,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4\3c&H773AE1&}彼此走路才七拐八折
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.83,0:01:40.79,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(240,240)\blur4\3c&H5A33BD&}但即便喑暗也能找到
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.79,0:01:44.00,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(240,240)\blur4\3c&H5A33BD&}只因你我小指勾牵
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.00,0:01:50.38,OP-CN,,130,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}是若有人 能互诉衷肠
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.38,0:01:53.59,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}魔法奇妙 却微不足道
